			"notes": "## Orion Client 0.2.0\n\n- Public config catalog with publishing, downloads and a local profile library\n- Visual presets, Mirage reflections and a dedicated waypoints section\n- Shared cosmetics and a unified in-game badge\n- Updated Saturation, Zoom, DamageIndicators and HitSound\n- New ChatAnimation and NoAnimations modules\n- Improved basketball and football controls\n\nRequires Minecraft 26.3, Fabric Loader 0.19.3 or newer, Fabric API and Java 25."
